\subtree{
  \title{Decision}
  \p{Benchmark the bundled seal on a nontrivial client. Adjust package granularity if projections or dependencies are expensive, without weakening the specification. Keep object construction explicit and existence classes Prop-valued. Validated finite shape computation may remain transparent in Theory. Measure before adding elaborate API generators or indexing services.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rationale}
  \p{Empty builds cannot detect performance failures through an actual interface.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rejected}
  \p{Performance fixes that silently expose sealed equations.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Acceptance}
  \p{\ref{at-fd-0002} performance record and \ref{ms-0003} regression measurements.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Status}
  \p{provisional.}
}
